menu "OCR application"
    config APP_OCR_BENCHMARK
        bool "Run the controlled 736/320 detection experiment"
        default n
        depends on PP_OCR_V6_REC_S16 && PP_OCR_V6_MODEL_IN_FLASH_RODATA
        help
            Show a static experiment screen and wait for 'b' on the console.
            Runs 160 measured detections plus 48 warmups, then reports DONE.
            Disable to return to the normal image selector.
endmenu
